# Cloudflare Pages redirects. Copied into dist/ by the build script.
#
# NOT in public/: Astro 7's rolldown build tries to parse extensionless files
# there as JavaScript modules, and this file fails with a PARSE_ERROR that
# takes the whole build down. Keep it here and let `npm run build` copy it.
#
# The About page was removed on 2026-08-19; the homepage carries the standing
# summary instead. It had been live and in the sitemap, so anything already
# crawled or bookmarked would otherwise hit a 404. Both spellings are listed
# because pages build as /about/index.html but links are written either way.
#
# 301, not 302: the page is gone for good, and a permanent redirect lets
# search engines retire the old URL rather than keep re-checking it.
/about/  /  301
/about   /  301
